
]log 46
⎕PW←200

DATA←"""
''
5⍴'hello'
42
3⍴1 2 3
⊂1⍴1
5⍴('') (0⍴0) (2⍴'Q' 3.2000000000000002) (3⍴5 8 13) (5⍴'D∆n''t')
⊂2⍴(⊂3⍴1 0 1) (2 3⍴4 6 4 6 4 6)
⎕UCS 1111
1⍴⎕UCS 1111
2⍴⎕UCS 1111 1112   ⍝ comment
2⍴⎕UCS 33 1112
"""

⍝ --------------------------------------------------------
∇Z←test_TF2 EXPR;X;XX;TF2;ASS
EXPR←(¯1+EXPR⍳'⍝')↑EXPR                 ⍝ remove comment
EXPR←⌽EXPR ◊ EXPR←⌽(∼∧\EXPR=' ')/EXPR   ⍝ remove trailing blanks
Z←"=" ◊ XX←VAR←⍎EXPR ◊ ASS←'VAR←',EXPR
'TESTING:' EXPR

TF2←2 ⎕TF 'VAR'   ⍝ TF2 is e.g. 'X←EXPR'
→(ASS≡TF2)⍴FORWARD_OK

ERROR0: 'TESTING 2 ⎕TF with:' EXPR 'failed.'
'    Forward 2 ⎕TF MISMATCH'
'    expected:' ◊ 4 ⎕CR ASS
'    got:     ' ◊ 4 ⎕CR TF2
Z←Z,'∆' ◊ →FORWARD_DONE

FORWARD_OK:
'FORWARD 2⎕TF was OK:' TF2 '-------------------------------'
FORWARD_DONE:
VAR←¯999

INV←2 ⎕TF TF2     ⍝ INV is 'VAR' on success and ⍬ on error

→(INV≢'VAR')⍴ERROR1
→(VAR≢XX)   ⍴ERROR2
'TESTING 2 ⎕TF' EXPR 'OK ≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡≡'  ◊ ''
→0

ERROR1: 'TESTING 2 ⎕TF with:' EXPR 'failed.'
'   inverse ⎕TF2 failed:'
'   VAR≡INV:' (VAR≡INV)
'   TF2:'   TF2
'   VAR:'   ◊ 4 ⎕CR VAR
'   INV:'   ◊ 4 ⎕CR INV
Z←Z,'⎕TF'
→0

ERROR2: 'TESTING 2 ⎕TF:' EXPR 'failed.'
'inverse ⎕TF2 returned a difference:'
'XX:'  ◊ 4 ⎕CR XX
'VAR:' ◊ 4 ⎕CR VAR
Z←Z,'≢'
→0
∇
⍝ --------------------------------------------------------

test_TF2 ¨ DATA

